"16":{"tp":"해를 갖는 부등식","key":"$x=\\dfrac23$을 대입","sol":["$x=\\dfrac23$","① $x\\le\\dfrac45$ (○) ② $x\\ge1$ (×) ③ $x\\gt3$ (×)","④ $x\\le\\dfrac23$ (○) ⑤ $x\\gt10$ (×)"],"check":"ok"},
